	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11128"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=223" title="View the profile of Heloisa">Heloisa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 162<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://members.shaw.ca/petethecanuk/Electravatar5.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Crazy Canuck<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=223"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1119.msg11128#msg11128"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1119.msg11128#msg11128">Re: Clerics !!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> September 13, 2004, 08:39:39 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							hmm not that I&#039;m playing anymore, I will make a few quick comments on OoW AA&#039;s.<br /><br />At first glance, they are just an extension of PoP AA&#039;s.. new definsive, healing,  stat increases etc etc... nothing too exciting..<br /><br /><br />The only, AA that is worth getting your sprinkler wet over is<br /><br /><b>Mnemonic Retention </b> <br />Prerequisites: Level 55 <br />AA Points: 3 (1 level, 3 total) <br />Type: Passive <br />Description: Gives you a 9th memorization slot <br /><br /><b>Expansive Mind</b> is also a nice one, increasing your FT cap by 5.. although it&#039;s quite expensive, 25AAs (5 per level). Worth it if you have &gt; FT 15 (which most clerics  these days have anyhow)... FT 20 /drool<br /><br />Good recap of all the new cleric AA&#039;s can be found here  <a href="http://eqcleric.gameglow.com/forums/showthread.php?t=19688" target="_blank">http://eqcleric.gameglow.com/forums/showthread.php?t=19688</a><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />[Hunter] <a href="http://www.wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?name=Kyleigh&amp;s_id=56" target="_blank"> <span style="color: orange;">Kyleigh</span></a> (Night Elf)<br />Azgalor <br /><img src="http://members.shaw.ca/sneaky_pete/Wowsiga.jpg" alt="" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11129"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
