	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11428"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=570" title="View the profile of Castamist">Castamist</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 46<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Castamist - 70 Archon - Rodcet<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=4859621" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=4859621&amp;img=5" alt="4859621" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/castamist@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="castamist@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=570"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:castamist@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1119.msg11428#msg11428"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1119.msg11428#msg11428">Re: Clerics !!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> September 26, 2004, 02:43:01 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<span style="color: Red;">Felt some de ja vu on a closer look of &quot;new&quot; AA&#039;s.</span><br /><br /><br /><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: Red;">Most new and useful?</span> </span> <br />Mnemonic Retention = Description: Gives you a 9th memorization slot <span style="color: Red;">I did this one right away.</span><br /><br />Divine Retribution Description: When activated, this randomly stuns any mobs that attack you for 2 seconds. Instant cast. 1.5 min duration. 36 min reuse <span style="color: Red;">long enuf for aggro to be managed, DA up, all mobs involved effected, and re-use reasonable.</span><br /><br />Sanctuary Description: Puts you at the bottom of all hate lists you are on for 3 minutes. You can heal yourself while this is active but if you turn on attack, cast any offensive spells or cast on another player then it drops. 1.5 sec cast. 72 min reuse. Comments: Very nice AA. Allows you to escape agro AND heal yourself. Can also be used to facilitate camping out of wipes<span style="color: Red;">The comment sounds good. Reuse time ick.</span><br />&nbsp;<br /><br /><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: Red;">Other new stuff, not as exciting I think</span></span><br />Healing Boon = Description: Allows you to critical Heal over Time (HoT) spells. <span style="color: Red;">Thank gawd! /shrug, not incredibly impressive.</span><br /><br />Eternal Breath = Description: Gives you permanent Enduring Breath effect <span style="color: Red;">wasted AA if not on a CR in airless zone? EB easy to get in many forms, including effect on regular armor.</span><br /><br />Mystical Attuning = Description: Increases the number of buff slots you have by 1 per level <span style="color: Red;">With new buffs could be nice to get more room. At the moment I don&#039;t max all buff slots on a regular basis or all raids</span><br /><br />Origin = Description: Teleports you to your home city. 15 second cast. 72 minute reuse. <span style="color: Red;">Got gate spell, gate neck to get to PoK, OT hammer, Faithstone. Good if on a CR and need to stop at bank for invisible potions maybe.</span><br /><br />Delay Death = increases purple depth before a death. <span style="color: Red;">Similar to death pact, Divine Intervention-lines, and Exquisite Benediction. I&#039;ll still die. /sigh</span><br /><br /><br /><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: Red;">De ja vu on most of these? /shrug</span></span><br />Expansive Mind<br />Reflexive Mastery <br />Healthy Aura<br />Discordant Defiance <br />Healing Gift Mastery <br />Healing Adept Mastery <br />Celestial Hammer <br />Celestial Rejuvenation <br />Fervent Benediction <br />Celestial Hammer - <span style="color: Red;">45 secs? dps but still extremely limited in usefulness?</span><br />Resplendent Cure <br />Destructive Fury <br />Chaotic Potential <br />Defensive Instincts <br /><br /><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: Red;">Non-life threatening/saving stuff</span></span><br />Salvage <br />Tailoring Mastery <br />Pottery Mastery <br />Fletching Mastery <br />Brewing Mastery <br />Baking Mastery <br />Blacksmithing Mastery<br /><span style="color: Red;"><br />Divine Retribution &amp; Sanctuary seem like best truly &quot;NEW&quot; AA&#039;s. Rest are upgrades to PREVIOUS AA we&#039;ve been given or not very important.</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: September 26, 2004, 02:46:59 am by Castamist</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
